###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Battle
medieval-mini:Battle rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf medieval-mini:HistoricalEvent .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Dynasty
medieval-mini:Dynasty rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#HistoricalEvent
medieval-mini:HistoricalEvent rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#King
medieval-mini:King rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf medieval-mini:Person .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Language
medieval-mini:Language rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Manuscript
medieval-mini:Manuscript rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Person
medieval-mini:Person rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Place
medieval-mini:Place rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#PoliticalTerritory
medieval-mini:PoliticalTerritory rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf medieval-mini:Place .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Queen
medieval-mini:Queen rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf medieval-mini:Person .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#ReligiousInstitution
medieval-mini:ReligiousInstitution rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://example.org/medieval-mini#Title
medieval-mini:Title rdf:type owl:Class .


